xnu27/ notices
==============

The patch series in this directory is applied to Apple's xnu-12377.121.6 source
(APSL 2.0, https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/xnu). Apple's own files are
not copied here; the patches only carry changed lines and keep the APSL headers of
files they add.

UniXNU layers (BSD-2-Clause-Patent)
-----------------------------------

patches/unixnu/*.patch
  UniXNU, https://github.com/UniXNU/UniXNU, commit 88604d0
  (patches/xnu-12377/), copied verbatim; the selection and order are in series.
patches/sheng/sheng-cpu-mmu.patch
  UniXNU-sheng, https://github.com/UniXNU/UniXNU-sheng, branch
  feat/ipados27-gpu-parity at 5b7d83c: per-file extract of
  patches/xnu-12377/zzzz-sheng-ipados27-bringup.patch and
  zzye-sheng-cpu-idle.patch (hunks unchanged; the patch header lists the files).
patches/sheng/sheng-kernel-stack-shift.patch
  UniXNU-sheng at 5b7d83c: osfmk/kern/stack.c hunk of the same bring-up patch,
  unchanged (unixnu_kernel_stack_shift for XnuPrelink's reviewed AMFI site).
patches/sm8550/native-smp-secondary-start.patch
  UniXNU-sm8550-common, https://github.com/UniXNU/UniXNU-sm8550-common,
  commit 23b2049fcd9e30356161def84231334fb55ecca9: start.s hunk of
  patches/xnu/native-smp-secondary.patch.
components/ArmCpu, components/ArmDTPlatform
  https://github.com/UniXNU/ArmCpu and https://github.com/UniXNU/ArmDTPlatform,
  copied unchanged with their own LICENSE files (revisions and hashes in
  components/README.md).
libpthread/explicit-kernel-address.patch
  UniXNU 88604d0, patches/libpthread/explicit-kernel-address.patch, copied
  verbatim; applied to libpthread-539.100.4 (APSL 2.0, fetched by CI at
  LIBPTHREAD_SHA, never copied here) in the order of libpthread/series.
tools/ci/build-libpthread27.py (outside this directory)
  port of UniXNU 88604d0 scripts/build-libpthread-kernel.py (the libpthread
  kernel sources, compile flags, collision renaming and import audit, and the
  bootstrap compiled with xnu's own compile record); the -force_load link into
  the DEVELOPMENT, chained and RELEASE kernels in tools/ci/build-xnu27.sh follows
  scripts/build-xnu-4k-baseline.sh (XNU_SOURCE_PTHREAD) and
  scripts/build-fileset-release-reference.py. Its own changes are listed in its
  docstring ("Fuxi:").
tools/mkadt-fuxi27.py (outside this directory) follows the tree shape of
  UniXNU-sheng scripts/make-sheng-adt.py.
tools/xnuprelink/ (outside this directory)
  XnuPrelink, https://github.com/UniXNU/XnuPrelink, commit 76452c6 (the
  revision UniXNU 88604d0 pins): the Python modules, tests, fixtures and
  LICENSE, copied verbatim (changes, if any, carry a "Fuxi:" comment).

