Fuxi layer
----------

patches/fuxi/*.patch are this repository's own changes (same terms as the rest of
the repository); the code they add to Apple files is under that file's APSL 2.0
header. 0002-builtin-crypto.patch ports the repository's xnu-8796 HMAC-SHA256
DRBG (xnu/patches/0014-sweet-kernel-hmac-prng.patch) and calls the digests already in xnu's osfmk/corecrypto.
